```uvl
features
  AIAssistant
    mandatory
      Model
        alternative
          GPT4o {cost 8, tokens "128k"}
          Gemini {cost 10, tokens "1M"}
          Claude {cost 9, tokens "200k"}
      Plan
        alternative
          Free {monthLimit 50}
          Premium {monthLimit 1000}
      Access
        or
          WebApp
          API {cost 2}
    optional
      FineTuning {cost 5}
      Temperature
      ImageGeneration
      WebSearch
constraints
  ImageGeneration => (GPT4o | Gemini)
  !(API & WebSearch)
  FineTuning <=> Premium
  sum(cost) < 15
```